  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using the imagenet_vit_l image encoder with concat fusion (config_036) achieves high validation accuracy (0.7150). However, uncertainty remains about whether the choice of image encoder (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) or fusion method (concat vs. weighted) is more impactful. This experiment tests resnet50 with weighted fusion, isolating the effect of these choices while keeping RNA encoder (scvi_n200), profile setting (multiprofile), and aggregation (avgpool) consistent. It clarifies whether the image encoder or fusion method is the primary driver of performance, avoiding redundant changes to multiple factors."
